{"articleNo":"2703","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2703&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010학년도 2학기 영어성적우수장학금 신청안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.01.05","hit":"12729","attachments":[{"name":"2010학년도 2학기 영어성적우수장학금 기준점수 제출자 명단2.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2703&attachNo=1894"},{"name":"영어성적우수장학금신청서1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2703&attachNo=2062"},{"name":"영어성적우수장학금 운영방침2.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2703&attachNo=2484"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2010학년도 2학기 영어성적우수장학금 신청안내</span></p>\n<div>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 지원자격</span></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">&nbsp;가. 장학금 신청 해당학기에(2010년 7월) 영어성적표를 제출하고 제출 점수(토익기준)가 600점 이상인자[붙임파일참조]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;나. 장학금 신청 해당학기의 성적이 2.5 이상이며, 최소 이수 학점은<br>15학점</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">(다만, 4학년은 8학점) 이상인 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;다. 2010학년도 2학기 교육역량어학장려장학생 및 그린에너지어학장려장학생 신청불가</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">2. 선발 방법</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 다음과 같은 평가 점수가 우수한자 순</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;평가 점수 = 100×(제출점수 - 기준 점수)/(1100-제출점수) +&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (제출점수 - 기준점수)/5</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학부 및 전공과 무관하게 평가점수 우수자 순으로 선발</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 32.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 영어</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">와 관련된 교내외 타 장학금과 중복 지급은 불가능하나, 이 외 타 장학금과는 중복 가능 (한국장학재단장학금 등록금 범위 내에 중복 가능)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 32.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 2010-2학기 영어성적우수장학금 신청자 중 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2010-2학기 제출점수가 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 32.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2010-1학기 제출점수보다 낮은 학생은 장학금 지급대상에서 제외 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">3. 장학 금액 및 지급 시기</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 장학금액 : 400,000원/학기</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 31.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 지급시기 : 1월에 기준 점수를 제출하고</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">7월에 장학금을 신청한자는 8월 중,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">7월에 기준점수를 제출하고 익년 1월에 장학금을 신청한자는 2월 중에 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">지급</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">4. 영어성적표제출기간 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011.1.10(월) ~ 2011.1.14(금)&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.9pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">기한경과 후 신청불가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">5. 영어성적표 제출장소 :&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccccff; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">각 학부 종합학사행정실 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccccff\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccccff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;테크노관종합학사행정실 : 054-478-7360&nbsp;&nbsp; 테크노관 105호</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccccff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;디지털관종합학사행정실 : 054-478-7752&nbsp; 디지털관 124호 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccccff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;글로벌관종합학사행정실 : 054-478-7597&nbsp; 글로벌관 127호 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">6. 기타</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 31.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 2010년 7월에 영어성적우수장학금을 신청한(기준점수 제출자)학생만 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">신청가능 - [붙임파일]참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 31.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">공인 영어 성적표는 제출일 기준 6개월 이내<br>&nbsp;(응시기준 2010. 7월 ~ 2010. 12월)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 31.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">2011학년도 1학기 영어성적우수장학금 신청기간은 1월 17일 공지예정 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 31.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">붙임&nbsp;1. 2010학년도 2학기 영어성적우수장학금 기준점수 제출자&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 명단&nbsp; 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 31.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 영어성적우수장학금 운영방침 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 31.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3. 영어성적우수장학금 신청서 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 31.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">※ 기타문의사항 : 054-478-7065</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 31.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">2011. 01. 05</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 31.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">금오공과대학교 학생과장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
